---
description: ONLY Apply this rule when code changes have been made to the python code.
alwaysApply: false
---
After each Python code change, run in order:

- `pipenv run flake8`
- `pipenv run black .`
- `pipenv run pytest -m 'not e2e'`

Ensure these non-e2e tests pass before proceeding. Do not run e2e tests by default.
